{"resourceIdentifier":"4230","resourceName":"TURK CIM BIOGAS PROJECT","description":"Turk Cim Biogas project (hereafter referred to as the project) is a biogas to energy project that will generate renewable energy by capturing biogas from animal manure via anaerobic digestion and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through biogas systems. The project is being implemented by TÜRK ÇİM TARIM S ANAYİ ANONİM ŞİRKETİ, as the Project Owner, in Kumdere village, İpsala district, Edirne province, in According to project owner, it is estimated that approximately 350 tons of dairy cattle and hens manure generated at animal farms will be collected daily or every two days through special\r\nsewage trucks equipped with close tanks to prevent any odor and/or manure leakages and to be fed into the anaerobic digesters at the proposed biogas power plant. The proposed project activity has two biogas engines installed at the biogas power plant, with 3.002 MWe.","location":{"latitude":40.827508,"longitude":26.353649},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-24","endExclusive":"2023-04-24","endInclusive":"2023-04-23"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4230"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ipsala"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"260983"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"EcoLance Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"16/03/202